s-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Illumine Designs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$5,580</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Measure the size of schematics and objects</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.33</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Can be used to determine the size of schematics on your property, leaving this item in your toolbar while using buildmode will display the scale while your building as well\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The Tape Measure is a tool that can be bought from <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> for the time being for $5,580. It allows the holder to see the size of schematics or structures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Tape Measure allows the user to see the size of any schematic or structure they have their mouse cursor over. This appears as a light blue rectangle over the schematic or structure with the stud measurements of its size. While outside of build mode, the user must hold the Tape Measure in order to see the pop-up; while in build mode, as long as the Tape Measure is in the user's inventory, these measurements will appear when hovering over any schematic or structure, and will stay pinned when that schematic or structure is selected.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tool was previously priced at $12,580.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163645\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019473/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.047      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   34.047      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1472-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163645 and revision id 13317. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools"],"links":[{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true}],"images":["Tape_Measure_unboxed.png","Tape_Measure.png"]}
